OL,3,GNEWSAThousands flock to coast for kite
OL,4,Afestival
OL,5,
OL,6,FTens of thousands of people have
OL,7,Fflocked to the coast for a kite
OL,8,Ffestival in Lancashire.
OL,10,FThe opening day of the annual three-day
OL,11,FSt Annes International Kite Festival
OL,12,Fwas disrupted by 40mph winds on Friday.
OL,14,FHowever, the wind dropped for the last
OL,15,Ftwo days of what organisers say is the
OL,16,FUK's biggest kite festival.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
