OL,3,GNEWSAThousands flock to coast for kite
OL,4,Afestival
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe skies have been awash with displays
OL,7,Ffrom more than 200 kite fliers from all
OL,8,Fover the world, including Australia and
OL,9,Fthe US, and a new art trail bringing
OL,10,Fshop windows to life with kite design
OL,11,Fcreated by local school children.
